   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 6. Matrix Exponential Calculation\n",
    "For $A = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 \\end{bmatrix}$, notice that $A^2 = -I$, $A^3 = -A$, $A^4 = I$, etc. \n",
    "Using the Taylor expansion:\n",
    "$$e^{At} = I + At + \\frac{A^2 t^2}{2!} + \\frac{A^3 t^3}{3!} + \\dots$$\n",
    "$$= \\left( 1 - \\frac{t^2}{2!} + \\dots \\right) I + \\left( t - \\frac{t^3}{3!} + \\dots \\right) A$$\n",
    "$$= \\cos(t) I + \\sin(t) A = \\begin{bmatrix} \\cos(t) & \\sin(t) \\\\ -\\sin(t) & \\cos(t) \\end{bmatrix}$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import scipy.linalg as la\n",
    "A = np.array([[0.0, 1.0], [-1.0, 0.0]])\n",
    "print(\"Matrix exponential at t=1:\\n\", la.expm(A * 1.0))\n",
    "print(\"Analytical formula output:\\n\", np.array([[np.cos(1), np.sin(1)], [-np.sin(1), np.cos(1)]]))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 7. Adjoint Equation Derivation\n",
    "Let $L = g(y(T))$ where $y(t)$ satisfies $\\frac{dy}{dt} = f(y(t))$.\n",
    "To compute $\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial y(t)}$, we define the adjoint $a(t) = \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial y(t)}$.\n",
    "Using the chain rule, the change in $a(t)$ over an infinitesimal step $dt$ is:\n",
    "$$a(t) = a(t+dt) \\frac{\\partial y(t+dt)}{\\partial y(t)}$$\n",
    "Using the Euler step $y(t+dt) \\approx y(t) + dt f(y(t))$, we get:\n",
    "$$\\frac{\\partial y(t+dt)}{\\partial y(t)} = 1 + dt f'(y(t))$$\n",
    "Substituting:\n",
    "$$a(t) = a(t+dt) (1 + dt f'(y(t)))$$\n",
    "$$a(t) - a(t+dt) = dt a(t+dt) f'(y(t))$$\n",
    "Divide by $dt$ and take $dt \\to 0$:\n",
    "$$\\frac{da(t)}{dt} = -a(t) f'(y(t))$$\n",
    "The boundary condition at the end is by definition $a(T) = \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial y(T)} = g'(y(T))$."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Theoretical proof."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 8. Forward vs Reverse SDE\n",
    "For the OU process $dx_t = -\\theta x_t dt + \\sigma dw_t$:\n",
    "The transition probability density $p(x_t|x_0)$ is Gaussian:\n",
    "$$p(x_t|x_0) = \\mathcal{N}\\left( x_t \\;\\Big|\\; x_0 e^{-\\theta t}, \\; \\frac{\\sigma^2}{2\\theta} (1 - e^{-2\\theta t}) \\right)$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Theoretical equation verified."
   ]
  },
